gantt
    title OdysseyEngine Implementation Phases
    dateFormat X
    axisFormat %s

    section Foundation
    Phase 1 - Foundation + MVP Nadir     :done, p1, 0, 1

    section Content Pipeline
    Phase 2 - Scene + Assets + Scripting :p2, 1, 2
    Phase 3 - Rich Behavior Library      :p3, 2, 3

    section Tooling
    Phase 4 - MCP Server + Skills        :p4, 3, 4

    section Multiplayer
    Phase 5 - Networking                 :p5, 4, 5

    section Polish
    Phase 6 - Debug + Profile            :p6, 5, 6

    section Demo
    Phase 7 - Multi-Armed Shooter Demo   :p7, 6, 7
